            "title": "2. THE STRING",
            "text": "<p>Selecting the string color is a crucial step that not only allows for personal expression but also brings the entire bracelet together, both visually and symbolically. It's a unique opportunity for clients to add a layer of meaning, whether through a favorite color or one that holds special significance.</p>",
