            "text": "<p>The final step of a SHAMBALLA JEWELS bracelet is the art of macramé braiding which is hallmark of every bracelet, executed with unparalleled skill by our artisans in Copenhagen. The handbraiding reflects our dedication to craftsmanship, merging traditional techniques with individual expression.</p>",
